{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先東寺法門錄中以外之者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯策子\n二帖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本不著譯者名與\n先請經其文小異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏\n譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輪波迦羅三藏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名大悲胎藏善無畏三藏本法潤阿闍\n梨傳者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善無畏三藏譯策子與先請\n經其文小異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無畏三藏譯說除障息災\n滅罪護國利生證菩提"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛智三藏譯說滅罪除災止風雨制賊等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "複二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達摩栖那譯安定皇甫直筆挍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子抄出雜文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯此同先請壽命經同本異譯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏\n譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大廣智三\n藏譯　說菩薩念誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名熾盛\n光佛頂戒賢三藏譯說除上王者下凡庶惡星淩逼命宿災難厄會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏譯說速入佛惠現為成佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名說滅罪除病令不生子女生子等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真諦寶思惟等三藏譯說真言\n威力受持者功德不可思議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛福壽三藏譯說得大\n福德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏\n譯五字真言也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名說\n除伏惡怨大驗自在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿目佉三藏譯功能如本經\n不能具記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門智通譯說除障成就悉地不說別法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏譯不說別法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名觀自在菩薩心真言念誦法不空三藏譯二紙策子說阿魯力\n迦真言不說功能及用法似不足也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名三紙策子不說功能呪文多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名一紙策子摩尼跋多羅大藥叉軍主說真言是大福德呪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯說鎮國攘災除疱疫鬼魅等及護力等\n增長"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無譯人名說觀自在菩薩現身令見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無作者名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解脫師子譯說用心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空譯說持念者功德不思議不能具記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名說得驗悉地之相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏譯五紙策子小說功能用法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迬胤三藏口傳說服菖蒲得聰明一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛智三藏譯此金剛界略通諸部次第如大日經七卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無畏三藏\n譯說不思議愈祇及藥法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯說念誦\n法則次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名十紙策子不說別法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名不說別法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云步觀都\n明王無人名策子不說功能及用法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空譯與先來本等異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏譯先請了說不動尊駈使\n行者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人金剛智三藏祕傳云云策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名策子說令施主得使者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子說降伏國家怨賊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說降伏冤敵法又有護摩法說調伏敬愛法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名七十四張說往昔阿修羅軍與天鬪戰天眾懷怕時佛令\n金剛菩薩降修羅軍投金剛菩薩說種種法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并梵字一卷不空三藏譯純一無雜文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并梵字一\n卷不空譯說降伏大力自在等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內有祈雨法不空三藏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名六紙策子說雨下七寶庫藏盈滿經未加義淨三藏補闕\n法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯一紙策子此法極略作法不明疑似不足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無抄出者名五紙但說印相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名十五紙說法則如常"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名如大日經十一紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門印玄受文三紙內有大藥\n叉女救急難真言如大日經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智惠輪傳文七紙具說次第法則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子說大神力自在釋天降伏呪餘者\n是定光佛化身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "跋駄木河譯說殊勝功德福壽無\n量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯說直釋\n種眼不見色佛令阿難說此陀羅尼即共眼明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯三紙未有立成法策子說免一切難儀軌法則具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名三紙策子說愛法降怨治病法人\n不論淨不淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名策子說毘那耶迦法不似前傳者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶思惟三藏譯三紙策子說降伏冤敵神驗自在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瞿多三藏譯更有符法說消除一切惡種患"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名說滅火溫氣病"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子說伏敬福等法有呪印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師子國三藏譯六紙長策子說世間種種殊勝\n事及出世淨法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名六紙策子說男女愛惡怨家殺不等\n法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名十二張策子說愛敬降怨富貴仙道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二十四張"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無譯人名說得大福德唯經末似不足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名六紙說種種別法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯有序七張說大福德悉地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達磨伽那譯六紙策子說愛增降怨止雨伏外道長年三悉地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "青龍寺沙門法全集六紙策子末有如來十號梵字具\n說次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "罽賓國三藏般若譯二十五紙說消除毒療病竝\n諸龍密言在此中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵漢兩字無集人名十六紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字樣小別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無集者名十九張三十五佛名號梵字二十六藥叉大將各真言阿彌\n陀大威德甘露蓮花王軍吒利真言三道陀羅尼三道菩提莊嚴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一行說敬愛富貴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯三紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏注策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛陀波利譯六張"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵漢\n兩字三紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上二讚一紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛部讚在大儀軌中二紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上六箇大讚都複一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "複五雜讚三張"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "複雜讚等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字二行策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字一紙策子唐云大青面"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子說敬愛福德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名策子此法撮略簡要壇尊異\n前者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竝印子前者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二夾者雜經一者百論並天竺書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏記六紙策子文句簡略儀趣深妙淺智難解是明三師記儀軌次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯四紙長策子此密意說深妙難解"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯說嚕荼羅部類差別六紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏說內有淨戒篇五紙策子說念誦次第大\n提"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門吉祥集　七紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿目\n佉三藏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無集者二十張說持呪功能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "缼第一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羅什三藏翻譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門會微迦紙七張"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惠菀法師述"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯無\n畏三藏了依密教出一行記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名七張策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內有十字佛頂真言儀及菩提心讚無人名七張"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內有辨才天女讚三紙無人名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名二紙策子是略不細明二三四五六合字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字策子如大日經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵字在別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說金剛杵義二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "策\n子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏出翻二紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛三藏釋一紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空三藏釋策子已上二文在隨求印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十餘文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗講法師文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字及一千餘義淨三藏述"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中天竺摩竭提國菩提樹下金剛座寺苾蒭瞿那畔捨沙\n集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二紙長策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於東京聖善寺得之多時綵色不分明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同苗一紙平生彩面樣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天竺和尚所圖作者五副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著梵漢兩字尊號於東京無畏三藏院得之多年已破三副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "員具足於長安城慈恩寺造玄和尚付屬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄和尚造之三副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二口小"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一口小"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中有舍利"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一口小此中有不空三藏平生執持杵中入佛舍利"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云生生檀子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩策子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元和年中者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為後記之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一紙策子說敬愛福德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為後記之"}
{"id": null, "n": "1108002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1108002", "type": "mod", "text": "新【大】，〔－〕【甲】，【原】鎌倉時代寫高山寺藏本，【甲】大日本佛教全書，【乙】享保年間刊豐山大學藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "1108003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1108003", "type": "mod", "text": "用【大】，〔－〕【甲】【乙】"}
